cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Bayesian Spatial Posterior with MAP/HPD and Zonal Mass (Section 3.4 reference implementation)"
abstract: >-
  Single-file C++17 reference implementation of Section 3.4 (Bayesian posterior
  and MAP/HPD estimation) of a dissertation on hybrid Bayesian tactical spatial
  identification of Wi-Fi signal sources: grid recursive inference in the
  log-domain, modality-factorized RSSI+FTM likelihood, MAP, local modes, HPD
  region, zonal posterior mass, out-of-map state and uncertainty budget.
type: software
